-- One closing edge: WITHIN d [OF anchor] or BEFORE date, never both. The
-- closing slot is one hole (EVERY-EACH-QUANTIFIER-SPEC §5.1.2), so a second
-- closing edge is a PARSE error that names the rule, rather than the list
-- of every token that may follow a WITHIN (adversarial pass of 2026-09-16,
-- R1-5).

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Buyer
    Seller

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Pay
    Deliver

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
bad MEANS PARTY Buyer MUST Pay WITHIN 30 BEFORE (YMD 2026 6 30)
